    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third/first-person hybrid shooter about free will. Follow a man and his journey to find out what it means to choose.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566150/extras/ab05198d4aa907f6c7d2d64f7060507c.avif?t=1749523042\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>short film</strong> mixed with combat  about exploring just who we are.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile, deliberate combat</strong> inspired by <i>Killer7</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a\u00a0<strong>decaying city</strong>\u00a0soaked in neon and regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it feels like there is only one path to live. Who really knows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566150/extras/d651cb0eaea630eaf798519745e29096.poster.avif?t=1749523042\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566150/extras/d651cb0eaea630eaf798519745e29096.webm?t=1749523042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566150/extras/d651cb0eaea630eaf798519745e29096.mp4?t=1749523042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Length: 15 - 45 min</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
